.SP
MEYERS, Randy. The new C: X Macros. [S. l.]: Dr. Dobbs’, 1 maio 2001. Disponível em: <https://www.drdobbs.com/the-new-c-x-macros/184401387>. Acesso em: 14 jul. 2023.
.SP
SCHWARZ, Keith. Advanced Preprocessor Techniques. [S. l.: s. n.], 2 out. 2008. Disponível em: <https://www.keithschwarz.com/cs106l/fall2008/handouts/060_Preprocessor_2.pdf>. Acesso em: 16 jul. 2023.
